@title Northwind design tokens v0.3
@subtitle Color, type, spacing and button tokens for review
@author Design systems team
@date 2026-10-19
@width wide

! Review notes: values below are the proposed tokens. Swatches and buttons cannot be painted on this page, so each color is given by hex with its measured contrast, and each button by its exact token recipe.

kpi Colors | 15 | 4 families | neutral
kpi Type sizes | 8 | ratio 1.25 | neutral
kpi Spacing steps | 8 | 4 px base | neutral
kpi Button variants | 4 | 3 sizes | neutral

## Color

### Brand and neutral

data colors = token,hex,role,on white,on neutral-900; brand-600,#5B3FD9,primary action and links,6.8,2.6; brand-500,#6E56E8,hover and focus ring,5.1,3.4; brand-100,#ECE8FD,selected row and tint,1.2,14.6; neutral-900,#14131A,body text and dark surface,17.9,1.0; neutral-700,#3B3947,secondary text,10.8,1.7; neutral-500,#6B6879,placeholder and icons,5.4,3.3; neutral-200,#DAD8E2,borders and dividers,1.4,12.7; neutral-50,#F6F5F9,page background,1.1,16.3
table colors

### Status

data status = token,hex,use,on white; success-600,#1F8F5F,confirmations and paid,4.6; warning-600,#B7791F,pending and caution,4.0; danger-600,#C93B3B,errors and destructive,5.0; info-600,#2563C9,neutral notices,5.7
table status

### Contrast against white

Text must reach 4.5:1 for AA. The dashed line is the pass mark.

data contrast = token,ratio; neutral-900,17.9; neutral-700,10.8; brand-600,6.8; info-600,5.7; neutral-500,5.4; brand-500,5.1; danger-600,5.0; success-600,4.6; warning-600,4.0
chart hbar contrast unit=:1 target="4.5 AA" labels title="Contrast ratio on white"

!! warning-600 is 4.0:1 on white and fails AA for body text. Allowed for icons and large text only, or darken to #9A6516 (5.3:1).

## Type scale

Base 16 px, scale ratio 1.25 rounded to whole pixels. Family is Inter for UI and JetBrains Mono for code.

data type = token,size px,line height px,weight,use; text-xs,12,16,500,captions and legal; text-sm,14,20,400,table cells and helper text; text-base,16,24,400,body; text-lg,18,28,500,lead paragraph; text-xl,22,30,600,card titles; text-2xl,28,36,600,section headings; text-3xl,36,44,700,page titles; text-4xl,48,56,700,marketing hero
table type bar="size px"
chart hbar type x=token y="size px" unit=px labels title="Size by step"

## Spacing and shape

data space = token,px; space-1,4; space-2,8; space-3,12; space-4,16; space-5,24; space-6,32; space-7,48; space-8,64
chart hbar space unit=px labels title="Spacing scale"

data shape = token,value,use; radius-sm,4 px,inputs and chips; radius-md,8 px,buttons and cards; radius-lg,16 px,modals; shadow-1,"0 1px 2px rgba(20,19,26,0.08)",cards at rest; shadow-2,"0 4px 12px rgba(20,19,26,0.12)",menus and hover; focus-ring,"0 0 0 3px #6E56E8 at 40%",all focusable controls
table shape

## Buttons

Each variant is listed with its exact tokens, so the rendered result can be checked against the spec. Height comes from size, never from padding guesses.

cards
### Primary
Fill brand-600, label white, no border, radius-md. Hover fill brand-500. Pressed fill #4A31B8. Disabled fill neutral-200, label neutral-500. Use once per view.
### Secondary
Fill white, label brand-600, 1 px border neutral-200, radius-md. Hover fill brand-100. Pressed fill #DDD6FA. Disabled label neutral-500.
### Ghost
No fill, label neutral-700, no border. Hover fill neutral-50. Pressed fill neutral-200. For toolbar and tertiary actions.
### Destructive
Fill danger-600, label white, radius-md. Hover fill #B03232. Always paired with a confirm step.

data sizes = size,height px,padding x px,font,icon px; sm,32,space-3 (12),text-sm,16; md,40,space-4 (16),text-base,20; lg,48,space-5 (24),text-lg,24
table sizes

### State matrix

data states = variant,rest,hover,pressed,focus,disabled; Primary,brand-600,brand-500,#4A31B8,focus-ring,neutral-200; Secondary,white,brand-100,#DDD6FA,focus-ring,white; Ghost,transparent,neutral-50,neutral-200,focus-ring,transparent; Destructive,danger-600,#B03232,#982A2A,focus-ring,neutral-200
table states

## Token file

```json
{
  "color": {
    "brand": { "600": "#5B3FD9", "500": "#6E56E8", "100": "#ECE8FD" },
    "neutral": { "900": "#14131A", "700": "#3B3947", "500": "#6B6879", "200": "#DAD8E2", "50": "#F6F5F9" },
    "danger": { "600": "#C93B3B" }
  },
  "space": { "1": 4, "2": 8, "3": 12, "4": 16, "5": 24, "6": 32, "7": 48, "8": 64 },
  "radius": { "sm": 4, "md": 8, "lg": 16 },
  "font": { "base": 16, "lg": 18, "xl": 22, "2xl": 28, "3xl": 36 }
}
```

## Open questions for review

- [ ] Darken warning-600 to pass AA, or restrict it to icons?
- [ ] Is radius-md at 8 px right for buttons, or should buttons use radius-sm?
- [ ] Keep text-4xl at 48 px, or step to 44 px to fit phone widths?
- [ ] Add a brand-700 for dark mode links?
